# PalMap Privacy Policy

**Effective date:** 08/22/2026

PalMap does not collect, transmit, sell, or share personal data.

The app stores visited-location progress locally on your device so that it can remember your selections. This information is not sent to the developer or to any third party. PalMap does not include accounts, advertising, analytics, tracking technologies, or third-party telemetry SDKs.

PalMap Pro purchases are processed by Apple through the App Store. The app checks Apple-signed transaction entitlements to determine whether Pro features are unlocked. The developer does not receive or store your payment-card details.

If a future version changes these practices, this policy and the App Store privacy disclosure will be updated before that version is released.

